WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:04.400
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:04.400
Such a sad midnight,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.030
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.030
overflowing with love.

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.600
kiiroi ringo o kajitteru

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.540
Gnawing at a yellow apple,

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.560
kimi wa hitoshirezu otona ni naru

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.560
you secretly become an adult.

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:27.000
tameiki iro shite mayoikomu

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:27.000
You sigh, having lost your way

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.770
ai o sagashite ikiteru

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.770
living in a search for love.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:35.050
suki yo tabun ne dakedo

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:35.050
Maybe I love you, but—

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:38.490
akai tsuki ga miteru

00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:38.490
the red moon is watching,

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:45.080
konna ni mo chikaku ni iru no ni

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:45.080
it waits nearby.

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.540
kanashimi sasou midnight

00:00:45.840 --> 00:00:49.540
Such a sad midnight.

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:49.610
I can say love

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.340
koboreru ai o choudai

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:53.340
It overflows with love.

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:53.340
will you love me?

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.950
tomadoi no hitomi no oku

00:00:53.360 --> 00:00:56.950
Lost within your eyes,

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:59.900
kokyuu o tomete

00:00:57.020 --> 00:00:59.900
I stop breathing.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:03.460
kimi no ai o katachi ni

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:03.460
The shape of your love,

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:08.110
mayonaka no taiyou

00:01:03.790 --> 00:01:08.110
is like the midnight sun.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:35.740
Yamada Shop

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:41.960
Sorry for the wait.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.670
Thank you for shopping.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:45.260
Need some help, Mom?

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:46.680
You're back, Yoshiko.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.390
Could you help me out?

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:50.050
While there's still time.

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:06.410
This is what you meant by,
 "While there's still time."

00:02:06.450 --> 00:02:07.530
That's right.

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.660
The store got empty so fast.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:10.570
Normally it's so...

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:14.370
He's in a rush today, I think.

00:02:14.370 --> 00:02:16.670
Oh, I see.

00:02:19.670 --> 00:02:22.590
It's been six months...

00:02:27.970 --> 00:02:28.970
I-I'm ho-

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:33.560
Onii-chan...

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:36.600
Quite unlucky, isn't he?

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:37.730
All the time.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:39.810
I-I'm home.

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:53.160
Come on, I'm in a hurry!

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.580
I'm really in a hurry!

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.100
See yo-

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.020
I'll see you later!

00:03:11.020 --> 00:03:12.050
Be careful.

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:15.050
Here we go!

00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:21.140
I-I'll see you later, for real!

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:34.280
...and their raw sea urchin with ketchup is so gross I could gag!

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:35.540
Huh? My shoelaces just untied!

00:03:35.540 --> 00:03:37.560
My panties...!

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.240
That's it! Go! Go!

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:39.450
Number Three starts to break from the pack!

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:42.340
Number Three's lead is increasing!

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:42.100
Come on, you can do it!

00:03:42.340 --> 00:03:43.890
And the jockey has fallen off his horse!

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:49.840
Hello?

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.380
Yeah, it's me-

00:03:52.810 --> 00:03:54.220
My phone just disconnected!

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:58.680
Hey!

00:03:58.680 --> 00:03:59.730
Yamada!

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:01.850
Oh, Kashimura!

00:04:01.850 --> 00:04:03.270
New bike?

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:04.770
Where are you headed, Yamada?

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:06.690
Just to Kai-

00:04:12.280 --> 00:04:14.700
Kashimura! Are you okay?

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:17.450
I'm fine.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:18.790
Sorry,

00:04:18.790 --> 00:04:19.870
but I'm in a hurry.

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.250
Hey there, Yamada.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.330
What's with the umbrella, Taguchi?

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:28.830
Well, I figured I might be needing it...

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:29.880
How come?

00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:31.920
Because you come down this road.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.220
See.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.510
Preparation is prevention.

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:43.810
Well, I gotta get going...

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:48.060
Looks like I underestimated you.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.870
I'll take the short cut.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:08.120
I don't always take this path,

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:11.250
but I'm in a hurry, I feel great,

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:14.090
and I have a feeling that today 
will be a great day!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:26.680
I made it down this path without anything bad happening.

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.400
Alright! Time to step it up a notch.

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:41.950
Oh great! Just what I needed, a flat tire...

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.500
I could get it fixed if I can get to Kai's house,

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.420
but there's no way I could make it that far.

00:05:47.420 --> 00:05:48.750
Bucket...Bucket...

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:52.540
First, I've gotta find water.

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:57.030
These things only happen when I'm in a hurry.

00:05:57.030 --> 00:05:58.820
Which is all the time, I guess.

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:03.260
I can get it fixed at Tenchi-senpai's place.

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.850
It doesn't look like anyone's home though.

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:06.600
Oh well...

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:17.610
I think I hear something...

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.260
Must be my imagination.

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:47.770
What is that horrible sound?

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.200
Are you alright?

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.660
You aren't injured, are you?

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.080
N-No.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.040
Really? That's great! So sorry.

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:54.770
I had no idea there wasn't a guide beacon.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:58.340
I slammed on the emergency brakes without realizing someone was below!

00:07:58.340 --> 00:08:00.860
I was really sweating buckets there...

00:08:00.860 --> 00:08:04.090
Then I saw you floating in the water, and totally freaked out.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:05.680
I was like, "Oh, no! What have I done!?"

00:08:05.680 --> 00:08:07.510
So then I jumped in the water to save you,

00:08:07.510 --> 00:08:08.260
and got my clothes all wet.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:11.560
But nothing happened to you, so you must be pretty tough.

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:15.190
Is Tenchi-kun training you hard?

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.780
You know T-T-Tenchi-senpai!?

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.440
Come to think of it, your body is covered in fresh wounds,

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:26.660
but living through that shock wave shows that you don't need any training.

00:08:26.910 --> 00:08:30.750
Which means this was collateral damage from Ryoko-san or Ayeka-san?

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:33.080
To think you can get caught in one of their fights

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:34.870
and walk away with only this...

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:44.460
Say, why don't you join GP?

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:46.930
GP is great.

00:08:46.930 --> 00:08:48.810
You can get technical certification while you work,

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:50.770
the benefits are really good,

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:52.560
you can get a lot of practical experience,

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:54.310
and holiday and overtime pay is...

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:57.770
They also have great medical care.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:08:59.770
W-What are you...

00:09:00.070 --> 00:09:00.780
I'm sorry,

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.030
I wish I could explain more but I'm in a hurry,

00:09:03.030 --> 00:09:05.410
and it seems I've been talking to myself this whole time.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.160
This pamphlet has all the
 information you should need.

00:09:08.740 --> 00:09:10.370
I-I'll take a look, then.

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:11.410
Great.

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:13.930
Well, I really need to get going now.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:16.500
Oh, right...

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.040
Here. Give this to Tenchi-kun for me.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.040
What's your name, anyway?

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.750
Seina. Yamada Seina.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:25.630
Seina-kun, huh?

00:09:25.630 --> 00:09:26.930
See you later, Seina-kun.

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.220
Oh, hey, wait!

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.200
W-Who are you?

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.560
I'm Amane. Amane Kaunaq.

00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:41.230
N-Not this again!

00:09:41.650 --> 00:09:43.570
What the...?

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.540
What in the world was that?

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:54.280
Oh! That's right!

00:10:03.340 --> 00:10:05.710
The pamphlet...

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:16.680
To: Tenchi-senpai

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:16.680
I got this letter from the pretty girl in the uniform.

00:10:11.430 --> 00:10:16.680
From: Seina Yamada

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:24.230
Alright! Almost at Kai's house.

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:25.570
Just a little bit further!

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:48.380
Not again!

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:09.200
K-Kiriko-san!

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.620
Seina-chan!

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.270
What happened to your bicycle?

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:20.160
Oh, just a little accident on the way.

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:25.030
You look fine as always.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:29.410
Y-Yes!

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:31.370
Come inside.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:33.790
Kai almost gave up waiting on you, Seina-chan.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:34.580
O-Okay.

00:11:41.090 --> 00:11:42.010
I'm alright.

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:43.340
It doesn't hurt.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.570
No, we still need to disinfect them.

00:11:45.570 --> 00:11:47.860
Seina, want me to fix your bike?

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:49.350
Can you fix it?

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:50.690
I'll give it a try.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:53.330
Now, now. Hold still.

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.200
S-Sorry.

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:57.010
You've grown taller again, haven't you?

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:57.970
I-I have?

00:11:57.970 --> 00:11:59.260
Well, you are a growing boy.

00:11:59.260 --> 00:12:01.790
O-Oh? Does it show?

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:04.280
Seina, these repairs will take a while.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:05.610
Go take a bath.

00:12:05.610 --> 00:12:07.110
Thanks, but I'll take one at home.

00:12:07.110 --> 00:12:08.790
Go ahead and take a bath.

00:12:09.230 --> 00:12:11.800
Although you might not want to wash that off...

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:17.280
What the...?!  When did...?!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:19.550
You might not want to go home looking like that, though.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:20.760
Kiriko-san!

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:21.990
I'm so glad.

00:12:21.990 --> 00:12:26.210
I was really worried. You're such a nice boy, but so unlucky.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.020
Things can change so much in just six months...

00:12:28.170 --> 00:12:30.510
You've got it all wrong, Kiriko-san!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:30.510
Moron.

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:33.010
There was a beautiful woman
 at the lake....and then...

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:36.300
All kinds of good things will happen to you from now on, Seina-chan!

00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:37.910
I wish you all the happiness in the world.

00:12:37.910 --> 00:12:38.690
...and the pamphlet-

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.020
Forget it.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:45.060
When she gets like that, there's no getting through to her.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.110
Yeah?

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:47.390
So, who is she?

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:48.240
Who's what?

00:12:48.240 --> 00:12:50.170
Your new girl.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:53.250
All she did was give me a pamphlet over at Tenchi-senpai's place.

00:12:53.510 --> 00:12:55.970
Do people normally kiss when they give you pamphlets?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.010
But I'm telling the truth!

00:12:58.240 --> 00:12:59.410
You can't tell me either?

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:02.340
Do you really think anything like that would happen to me?

00:13:06.420 --> 00:13:07.890
Forget it. Just go take your bath.

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.750
She rescued me when I 
almost drowned in the lake.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.180
I see.

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.610
Whatever. Take your bath.

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:16.320
You don't believe me?

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:20.160
I believe you. Just take your bath.

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:21.210
Kai...

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:24.440
I know more than anyone else that you aren't that type-

00:13:25.110 --> 00:13:26.430
of person.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:27.440
Sorry.

00:13:27.440 --> 00:13:28.520
It's all my fault.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:30.610
I know that too,

00:13:30.610 --> 00:13:32.280
but my sister doesn't.

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.420
How did it happen?

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:39.880
Maybe it was after I blacked out...

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.510
Seina-chan, I put your towel right...

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:54.050
S-Seina-chan!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.640
Kai! Come quick!

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:57.390
Seina-chan swallowed some soap!

00:13:57.390 --> 00:13:58.820
What should I do? Kai!

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:07.900
Thank you for the cake.

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:09.280
I fixed your bike.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:11.990
I made them myself, but they are nothing special.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:12.030
Man, that thing was a real clunker.

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.580
Why don't you share some with your mother and Yoshiko-chan?

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.280
I had to replace everything but the handlebars.

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:15.800
Okay.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:20.410
Um, about that lipstick...

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:21.180
Seina.

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:23.160
Let it go for now.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:24.670
She'll be here for a few more days,

00:14:24.670 --> 00:14:26.120
so take your time to clear it up.

00:14:26.120 --> 00:14:26.930
Gotcha.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:30.210
See you later, Seina-chan!

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:31.010
Bye!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.800
Be careful on your way home!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:34.690
It's probably no use saying that to him.

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.400
Right!

00:14:38.890 --> 00:14:40.530
Are you okay, Seina-chan?!

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.310
I'm okay!

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:45.240
The cakes are, too!

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.730
You're so silly.

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:01.750
GP.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.500
Pamphlet...

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:06.960
What was that?

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:18.550
I-I didn't just see that...

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:19.630
I didn't see anything.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:22.860
I didn't see anything at all!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.180
What is this?

00:15:29.180 --> 00:15:30.110
Dunno.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.560
Says he doesn't know!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:34.290
What do you think, dear?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:36.420
What do you think it's made of?

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:38.800
I'm not quite sure... It is the 21st century though...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.740
I wonder what it's for.

00:15:40.740 --> 00:15:42.050
Like Kurashiki Tivoli Park, maybe?

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:45.150
Maybe it's a guidebook for a new theme park.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:46.550
I don't think so...

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:47.760
Hey,

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:49.830
I bet if you fill it out and turn it in,

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.330
you'll win a prize.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:55.500
I bet there'll be a really beautiful girl there who will greet you and...

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:57.330
Now where did I put my pencil...

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.420
Here's a pencil.

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:01.880
Amane-san...

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:03.280
Sign your name here.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:05.510
Yes, good job.

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:06.940
We just need his thumb print now.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:07.880
What are you making me do?

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:08.910
Mother, the ink pad!

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:12.130
W- What are you doing?!

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.480
You might win a prize.

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:17.830
No! Wait!

00:16:18.160 --> 00:16:21.520
We already went through the trouble of filling it out so far...

00:16:21.520 --> 00:16:22.370
Stop it!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:23.980
You're freaking me out!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:26.340
Just be quiet and push down!

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:27.800
You can do it, Mom!

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:28.840
Dad's rooting for you too!

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:29.850
You're being selfish!

00:16:30.790 --> 00:16:34.050
My thumb print... belongs to m-

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:36.800
Nice one, Yoshiko!

00:16:36.800 --> 00:16:37.260
Yeah!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:39.110
Your thumb print belongs to me!

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.820
Whatever... just do whatever you want now.

00:16:41.820 --> 00:16:45.050
I bet we get a prize!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:45.880
I wonder what kind.

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.390
Who cares!

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:48.660
Prize! Prize! Prize! Prize!

00:17:01.140 --> 00:17:02.990
What a day.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:08.490
I don't know what it's for, but I bet if I show it to Kiriko-san,

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:09.860
and ask her to go with me...

00:17:09.860 --> 00:17:10.670
<i>Kiriko-san,</i>

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:11.580
<i>can you see it?</i>

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.700
<i>That's the latest attraction, the GP!</i>

00:17:14.700 --> 00:17:18.650
<i>I don't really know what it is, but it's beautiful, Seina-chan!</i>

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:19.480
It's decided!

00:17:19.480 --> 00:17:21.550
Tomorrow after school I'm going straight to Kai's house!

00:17:21.550 --> 00:17:23.220
Well, time to hit the hay!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:51.080
So soft.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:58.180
And fluffy.

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.340
Cut it out, Mom.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.440
Um...

00:18:19.320 --> 00:18:21.280
Where am I?

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:22.250
Who are you?

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:30.290
Do you like the feel of my crew cut?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.660
Good morning, Yamada Seina-kun.

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.220
I will be your guide.

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:36.540
Guide?

00:18:36.540 --> 00:18:38.300
What in the world is this?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:40.270
Congratulations on entering the GP Academy!

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:41.880
GP?

00:18:41.880 --> 00:18:42.880
Entering?

00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:44.220
What are you talking about?

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.480
Let's see...

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.730
This is your name and handwriting, correct?

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.820
Y-Yes.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:51.610
And this is your thumbprint?

00:18:51.670 --> 00:18:53.320
Y-Yes.

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:55.350
Right. Then there is nothing to explain.

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.300
You've enlisted in the GP!

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:58.160
B-But that was...

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.580
That's what she meant...

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:04.560
But I can't just enlist!

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:06.840
I've still got school, and my family
 doesn't even know.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.340
No, your family has given their consent.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.540
Would you like to see their message?

00:19:15.620 --> 00:19:17.040
Ready in five...

00:19:17.040 --> 00:19:17.830
Four...

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:18.500
Three...

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.370
Oh, are we recording now?

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.690
Dad! We're taping!

00:19:24.980 --> 00:19:27.190
Dad! Mom! And Yoshiko!

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:30.840
Seina! You're my son!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.380
You've grown into a fine first-born son that our family can be proud of!

00:19:33.380 --> 00:19:35.130
Don't worry! It's okay now!

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:36.390
Yoshiko here!

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:37.350
Am I on?

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:38.350
What is this?

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.650
Is this VHS or Beta?

00:19:38.350 --> 00:19:40.690
Video mail. We recorded it just before we left.

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:41.730
Make me look pretty, okay?

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:42.320
Before we left?

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:44.190
I've never been on TV before!

00:19:44.150 --> 00:19:45.890
The truth is, I meant to tell you this someday,

00:19:45.890 --> 00:19:48.320
but our family budget has always been tight

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:50.740
because of all your medical costs
 and hospitalizations.

00:19:50.740 --> 00:19:53.440
And all the customers stayed away whenever you were around.

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.550
That's my cake!

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:58.250
Yoshiko will be in junior high soon and girls are so expensive.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:02.580
And the shop has been needing repairs.

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:05.750
You're such a nice boy to think of the good of the family!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:06.730
Yoshiko! My cakes!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.210
Kiriko-san gave those to me!

00:20:07.300 --> 00:20:12.640
We worked it out with your school, so don't worry!

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:12.680
Dad! Not you too! Save me some!

00:20:12.680 --> 00:20:14.770
Mom! You had some too!

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:17.600
You've still got creme on your face!

00:20:17.600 --> 00:20:19.480
Don't worry about us,

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:21.430
you don't need to come back 
until you've made it big.

00:20:21.430 --> 00:20:22.430
Hurry up, Mom!

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:25.230
Hold your horses, I only have one line left!

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:26.420
Let's see...

00:20:26.420 --> 00:20:30.380
Oh right. Don't forget to send us some money once in a while.

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:31.450
Later, Onii-chan!

00:20:31.450 --> 00:20:33.110
We're going to Hawaii!

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:34.360
But I guess you don't need any souvenirs.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.220
Bye!

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:37.380
I tried to talk them out of it, but, you know...

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.370
See you later!

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:40.000
Isn't it still taping?

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:42.740
That's okay, they can edit it out.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.550
We'd better hurry or we'll miss our plane.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:46.880
END

00:20:47.920 --> 00:20:49.760
Touching, wasn't it, Seina-kun?

00:20:49.760 --> 00:20:51.070
Now, let me explain your dut-

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:52.550
I'm leaving!

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:53.990
I'm leaving! Going home!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:55.550
Let me go!

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:56.640
I didn't get to have my cake!

00:20:56.640 --> 00:20:58.380
I didn't agree to this!

00:20:58.380 --> 00:21:00.180
I'm terribly sorry, but I can't...

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:01.650
Then I'll go home on my own!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:02.700
Which way to the train station?

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:03.940
Seina-kun,

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:06.000
do you know what the GP is?

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:14.380
G stands for Galaxy.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.410
P stands for Police.

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:51.200
Galaxy Police...

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:57.240
GP...

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:05.540
Galaxy Police...

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:21.570
uchuu de saitei saiaku

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:21.570
You're the worst, most hopeless,

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:26.690
un warui Unlucky Boy

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:26.690
most unlucky boy in space.

00:22:32.230 --> 00:22:33.900
anna koto shite te mo

00:22:32.230 --> 00:22:33.900
No matter what you do,

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.630
konna koto shite te mo

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:36.630
no matter what you do,

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:41.420
otozureru jiko tensai sugoi wana

00:22:36.900 --> 00:22:41.420
you can't escape the accidents, disasters and traps

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:43.710
anata wa nigerarenai

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:43.710
that come your way.

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.280
keikai shite te mo

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:47.280
Even if your really careful...

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:49.990
ikinari shichatte mo

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:49.990
And even if you're not...

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:56.220
saitei saiaku dame dame no

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:56.220
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:00.690
anata wa doshiyou mo nai

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:00.690
You're a lost cause.

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:10.640
anata ga saitei saiaku

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:10.640
You're the worst and most hopeless...

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:15.260
anata wa Unlucky Boy

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:15.260
You're an unlucky boy.

00:23:15.260 --> 00:23:20.340
dakedo anata shika mienai

00:23:15.260 --> 00:23:20.340
But all I can see is you.

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:25.860
sonna anata shika mienai

00:23:20.520 --> 00:23:25.860
But all I can see is you, the way you are.

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:33.720
I've made it into Outer Space!

00:23:33.740 --> 00:23:35.450
And I'm riding on a spaceship?!

00:23:35.480 --> 00:23:37.860
I'm not sure what's going on, 
but it seems interesting,

00:23:37.860 --> 00:23:39.000
so I don't mind.

00:23:39.020 --> 00:23:40.220
What's that?

00:23:40.220 --> 00:23:40.650
Huh?!

00:23:40.650 --> 00:23:41.900
Pirates?!

00:23:41.900 --> 00:23:44.040
Next time on Tenchi Muyo GXP!
